## Validation limitation and release decision

The execution environment is Linux with Node.js `v22.16.0`, below the project requirement `>=24.17.0`. `npm ci` could not complete because requests to the npm registry failed with `EAI_AGAIN`; the full Tesseract.js dependencies therefore were not installed, and I could not rerun the real OCR acceptance pipeline on the patched source here.

**This is a targeted code repair, not an OCR acceptance pass. Production remains NO-GO** until the patched source is installed and tested on Windows Node.js 24, the full 13-stage acceptance suite passes, all annotated fixtures match exactly, and the separate native-Windows-Tesseract and authorized Discord smoke-test gates are complete.

